  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAnti-Money Laundering\n\t\tCapium AML\n\n### Biometric Check\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 9 Jul, 2025 at  4:56 PM\n\n\t\tCompanies House is implementing mandatory identity verification checks for individuals registering or managing UK companies, including directors, people with significant control (PSCs), and those filing information on behalf of a company.\n\nThe new Biometric verification feature is now available through Capium, in partnership with Veriphy. This integration allows accountants to seamlessly complete biometric checks within the Capium platform, enhancing security and streamlining compliance workflows. \n\nThe check is priced at £2.50 plus vat per check.\n\nOur biometric checks have been created to make verifying client identity much more efficient and effective. They allow you to:\n\nAlign your customer due diligence processes with internal risk assessments\nAvoid penalties that can cause financial and reputational harm to your firm\nProtect your firm from fraudsters\nReduce time-to-revenue by streamlining the client onboarding process\n - Gain ultimate peace of mind of remote and face-to-face client identity through state-of-the-art government-standard biometric technology\n\nBiometric Check\n\nNavigation: My Admin > My Firm > AML\n\nTo perform a Biometric check click on 'Perform Check' then 'Biometric Check' as shown on the picture below. \n\nYou will now be directed to the Biometric Check page, where you can input either your own details or your client's to begin the verification process.\n\nYou will now need to enter the mandatory information into the system:\n\nGender \nTitle\nFirst Name\nSurname \nDate of Birth\n\nEmail Address\nUK Mobile Number  \n\nIf you don't have a reference number you can click on 'I don't wish to enter a reference'.\n\nOnce all mandatory personal details have been entered into the system, click ‘Perform Check’. This will generate and send an Email/SMS to the appropriate recipient, either yourself or your client, based on whose information was provided for the biometric verification.  \n\n*Disclaimer: Capium does not store sensitive personal data, will only pass it to third party for verification and provide you access to the report as an outcome.\n\nYou or your client will now receive an Email/SMS from Veriphy to complete an identity verification check on behalf of Veriphy.  \n\nThis step requires you to:\n\nBe in a well-lit room\nScan or upload an identity document, avoiding glare and reflections \nTake a selfie \n\nTo do this click on 'here' in the Email or the link in your SMS.\n\n*Disclaimer: There's no need to log into Veriphy to complete the biometric check. \n\nOnce the Biometric Check has been completed, you can easily review the results within the My Admin portal. \n\nNavigation: My Admin > My Firm > AML\n\nHere, you'll find a list of all compliance checks previously conducted, with the most recent appearing at the top. \n\nTo view the result of the Biometric Check, click on the '3 dots' under the Action column, either select 'View PDF or Download PDF'. \n\nOpening or downloading the report will automatically update the Result tab on the page, ensuring your records remain current. \n\n*Disclaimer: There's no need to log into Veriphy to view your result.  \n\nBiometric checks & Entering the information into Companies House (ACSP) : https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000269284?portalId=9000044273\n\nClick this link to know more about the upcoming changes to Companies House Identity verification and ACSP's: https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000267335?portalId=9000044273\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000116723\">Anti-Money Laundering</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000193271\">Capium AML</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Biometric Check\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 9 Jul, 2025 at  4:56 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Companies House is implementing mandatory identity verification checks for individuals registering or managing UK companies, including directors, people with significant control (PSCs), and those filing information on behalf of a company.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helv